Enterprise Financial Data Platform | JUnit 5 | Mockito | MockMvc

1. Objective

Increase automated confidence around the Day 8 error contract and the HTTP controller layer. Day 9 adds focused exception-handler unit tests plus MockMvc controller tests without requiring Oracle or starting the full application.

