9. Test Commands Used

PowerShell-specific quoted -D properties were used to prevent argument parsing issues:

mvn -pl customer-service -am "-Dtest=CustomerControllerTest" "-Dsurefire.failIfNoSpecifiedTests=false" test

mvn -pl account-service -am "-Dtest=AccountControllerTest" "-Dsurefire.failIfNoSpecifiedTests=false" test

mvn clean test

A first unquoted PowerShell command was parsed incorrectly as a Maven lifecycle phase; quoting the -D arguments fixed it. A missing static Mockito verify import was also corrected in CustomerControllerTest.

