13. Interview Explanation

I used layered automated testing. Mockito unit tests validate business logic, direct GlobalExceptionHandler tests protect exception-to-error-code mappings, and standalone MockMvc tests verify the HTTP contract including validation, status codes, JSON structure, and controller-to-service interaction. The controller tests mock the service layer, so they are fast and do not require Oracle. Full integration tests with real infrastructure can be added later using Testcontainers.